From 11b60081266b138fe3832a5ca34fce1468354886 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: a <a@a>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:55:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: continue a Claude chat on a limit-fallback profile, and
 show its API spend

A profile with limitFallback: true (extending its base provider) is used
while the base is at a usage limit: the limit callout offers to move the
chat there in place and continue; new chats start there; chats move back
when the limit resets, including chats whose idle runtime was collected
(rewritten on disk, so their next load uses the base). Auto-resume after a
limit is on unless a chat opts out. A profile with creditBudget records
estimated spend per turn in $PASEO_HOME/credit-ledger.jsonl, shown per chat
and per billing cycle.
